@Kontaktverwalter.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:1337

### Get all contacts
GET {{Kontaktverwalter.API_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/list
Accept: application/json

### Search for a contact
GET {{Kontaktverwalter.API_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/John
Accept: application/json

### Update a contact
POST {{Kontaktverwalter.API_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/update/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}